WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:05.518
Services manages the individual care services shown on the website.

00:00:05.568 --> 00:00:09.830
Add a service, open an existing one, or reorder the list.

00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:13.083
The ordering has its own publishing action.

00:00:13.133 --> 00:00:18.756
Opening Home Nursing Care shows the details behind its public service page.
